#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the documentation for the &kde; &kcontrol; module that configures mice "
"and other pointing devices."
msgstr ""
"នេះ​គឺ​ជា​ឯកសារ​សម្រាប់​ម៉ូឌុល​ត្រួត​ពិនិត្យ Kde ដែល​កំណត់​រចនា​សម្ព័ន្ធ​កណ្ដុរ "
"និង​ឧបករណ៍​ចង្អុល​ផ្សេង​ទៀត ។"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"
msgstr "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "KControl"
msgstr "KControl"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid "mouse"
msgstr "កណ្ដុរ"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mouse"
msgstr "កណ្ដុរ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This module allows you to configure your pointing device. Your pointing device "
"may be a mouse, a track ball, a touch-pad, or another piece of hardware that "
"performs a similar function."
msgstr ""
"ម៉ូឌុល​នេះ​អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យ​អ្នក​កំណត់​រចនា​សម្ព័ន្ធ​ឧបករណ៍​ចង្អុល​របស់​អ្នក ។ "
"ឧបករណ៍​ចង្អុល​របស់​អ្នក​អាច​ជា​កណ្ដុរ គ្រាប់​បាល់ បន្ទះ​ចុច "
"ឬ​ឧបករណ៍​ផ្សេង​ទៀត​ដែល​ដំណើរ​ការ​មុខងារ​ស្រដៀង​នេះ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This module is divided into several tabs: <link linkend=\"mouse-general\">"
"General</link>, <link linkend=\"cursor-theme\">Cursor Theme</link>"
", <link linkend=\"mouse-advanced\">Advanced</link> and <link "
"linkend=\"mouse-navigation\">Mouse Navigation</link>"
". There may also be one or more additional tabs if you have a Logitech mouse or "
"trackball, providing access to special features."
msgstr ""
"ម៉ូឌុល​ត្រូវ​បាន​ចែក​ជា​ថេប​ច្រើន ៖ <link linkend=\"mouse-general\">ទូទៅ</link> "
"<link linkend=\"cursor-theme\">ស្បែក​ទស្ស​ទ្រនិច</link> "
"<link linkend=\"mouse-advanced\">កម្រិត​ខ្ពស់</link> "
"និង <link linkend=\"mouse-navigation\">ការ​រុករក​កណ្ដុរ</link>"
" ។ អាច​មាន​ផ្ទាំង​បន្ថែម​មួយ ឬ​ច្រើន​បើ​អ្នក​មាន​កណ្ដុរ  Logitech ឬ​គ្រាប់​បាល់ "
"ដែល​ផ្ដល់​ការ​ចូល​ដំណើរ​ការទៅ​លក្ខណៈ​ពិសេស ។"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "General"
msgstr "ទូទៅ"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "Button Order"
msgstr "លំដាប់​ប៊ូតុង"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are left-handed, you may prefer to swap the functions of the "
"<mousebutton>left</mousebutton> and <mousebutton>right</mousebutton> "
"buttons on your pointing device by choosing the <quote>Left handed</quote> "
"option. If your pointing device has more than two buttons, only those that "
"function as the <mousebutton>left</mousebutton> and <mousebutton>"
"right</mousebutton> buttons are affected. For example, if you have a "
"three-button mouse, the <mousebutton>middle</mousebutton> button is unaffected."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reverse scroll direction"
msgstr "បញ្ច្រាស​ទិស​រមូរ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With this checkbox selected, the scroll wheel (if any) will work in the "
"opposite direction (so that if rolling the top of the scroll wheel towards you "
"previously causes a scroll down, then it will now cause a scroll up). This may "
"be useful to handle a unusual setup of the X server."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "Double-click to open files and folders (select icons on first click)"
msgstr "ចុច​ទ្វេរ​ដង​ដើម្បី​បើក​ឯកសារ និង​ថត (ជ្រើស​រូប​តំណាង​នៅ​ពេល​ចុច​ដំបូង"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is not checked, icons/files will be opened with a single click "
"of the <mousebutton>left</mousebutton> mouse-button. This default behavior is "
"consistent with what you would expect when you click links in most web "
"browsers. If checked however, icons/files will be opened with a double click, "
"while a single click will only select the icon or file. This is the behavior "
"you may know from other desktops or operating systems."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid "Single-click to open files and folders"
msgstr "ចុច​ម្ដង​ដើម្បី​បើក​ឯកសារ និង​ថត"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the default setting for &kde;. Clicking once on an icon will open it. "
"To select you can drag around the icon(s) or <keycombo action=\"simul\">"
"&Ctrl;<mousebutton>Right</mousebutton></keycombo> click, or simply click and "
"hold to drag it. You can also enable automatic selection of icons using the "
"<guilabel>Automatically select icons</guilabel> checkbox, discussed below."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid "Change pointer shape over icons"
msgstr "ផ្លាស់ប្ដូរ​ព្រួញ​នៅ​លើ​រូប​តំណាង"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When this option is checked, the shape of the mouse pointer changes whenever it "
"is over an icon."
msgstr ""
"ពេល​ធីក​ជម្រើស​នេះ "
"រូបរាង​នៃ​ព្រួញ​កណ្ដុរ​ផ្លាស់ប្ដូរ​ពេល​ណា​ដែល​វា​នៅ​ពី​លើ​រូប​តំណាង ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This option should be checked in most situations. It gives more visual feedback "
"and says, in essence, if you click here, something will happen."
msgstr ""
"គួរ​តែ​ធីក​ជម្រើស​នេះ​ក្នុង​ស្ថានភាព​ជា​ច្រើន ។ "
"វា​ផ្ដល់​ឲ្យ​នូវ​មតិ​ព័ត៌មាន​ដែល​មើល​ឃើញ​បន្ថែម និង​និយាយ ក្នុង​ករណី​ខ្លះ "
"បើ​អ្នក​ចុច​ទីនេះ អ្វី​នឹង​កើត​ឡើង ។"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid "Automatically select icons"
msgstr "ជ្រើស​រូប​តំណាង​ដោយ​ស្វ័យប្រវត្តិ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As noted above, if you have <guilabel>Single-click to open files and "
"folders</guilabel> selected, you can select icons by dragging around them, or "
"by using <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<mousebutton>Right</mousebutton>"
"</keycombo> click. If you routinely need to select icons, you may want to "
"enable this checkbox, which will allow icons to be selected automatically by "
"pausing over the icon. The <guilabel>Delay:</guilabel> "
"slider determines how long is required before the automatic selection takes "
"effect."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid "Visual feedback on activation"
msgstr "មតិ​ព័ត៌មាន​ដែល​មើល​ឃើញ​ពេល​សកម្ម"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When this option is checked, &kde; gives you visual feedback whenever you click "
"on something and activate it."
msgstr ""
"ពេល​ធីក​ជម្រើស​នេះ Kde "
"ផ្ដល់​ឲ្យ​អ្នក​នូវ​មតិ​ព័ត៌មាន​​ពេល​ណា​ដែល​អ្នក​ចុច​លើ​អ្វី "
"ហើយ​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​វា​សកម្ម ។"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cursor Theme"
msgstr "ស្បែក​រូប​តំណាង"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This tab allows you to select from a number of cursor themes. A preview of the "
"cursor display is shown above the listbox."
msgstr ""
"ថេប​នេះ​អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យ​អ្នក​ជ្រើស​ពី​ស្បែក​រូប​តំណាង​មួយ​ចំនួន ។ "
"ការ​មើល​ជាមុន​នៃ​ការ​បង្ហាញ​រូប​តំណាង​ត្រូវ​បាន​បង្ហាញ​ខាងក្រោម​ប្រអប់​បញ្ជី ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The features provided by this tab may not be available on some systems. Your "
"system may need to be updated to support cursor themes."
msgstr ""
"លក្ខណៈ​ពិសេស​ដែល​ផ្ដល់​ដោយ​ថេប​នេះ​អាច​មិន​មាន​នៅ​លើ​ប្រព័ន្ធ​ខ្លះ ។ "
"ប្រព័ន្ធ​​របស់​អ្នក​អាច​ត្រូវការ​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​ទាន់​សម័យ​ដើម្បី​គាំទ្រ​ស្បែក​ទស្ស​ទ្រ"
"និច ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have additional cursor themes available to you, you can install and "
"remove them using the buttons below the listbox. Note that you cannot remove "
"the default themes."
msgstr ""
"បើ​អ្នក​មាន​ស្បែក​ទស្ស​ទ្រនិច​បន្ថែម អ្នក​អាច​ដំឡើង "
"និង​យក​ពួក​វា​ចេញ​ដោយ​ប្រើ​ប៊ូតុង​ខាងក្រោម​ប្រអប់​បញ្ជី ។ "
"ចំណាំ​ថា​អ្នក​មិន​អាច​យក​ស្បែក​លំនាំ​ដើម​ចេញ​បាន​ទេ ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "កម្រិត​ខ្ពស់"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pointer acceleration"
msgstr "ការ​បង្កើន​ល្បឿន​ទ្រនិច"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:154
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This option allows you to change the relationship between the distance that the "
"mouse pointer moves on the screen and the relative movement of the physical "
"device itself (which may be a mouse, track-ball, or some other pointing "
"device.)"
msgstr ""
"ជម្រើស​នេះ​អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យ​អ្នក​ផ្លាស់ប្ដូរ​ទំនាក់ទំនង​រវាង​ចម្ងាយ​ដែល​ព្រួញ​កណ្ដុរ"
"​ផ្លាស់ទី​លើ​អេក្រង់ និង​បម្លាស់​ទី​ដែល​ទាក់ទង​នៃ​ឧបករណ៍​ពិត​ខ្លួន​វា "
"(ដែល​អាច​ជា​កណ្ដុរ គ្រាប់​បាល់ ឬ​ឧបករណ៍​ចង្អុរ​ផ្សេង​ទៀត ។)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A high value for the acceleration multiplier will lead to large movements of "
"the mouse pointer on the screen, even when you only make a small movement with "
"the physical device."
msgstr ""
"តម្លៃ​ខ្ពស់​សម្រាប់​មេគុណ​ការ​បង្កើន​ល្បឿន​នឹង​នាំ​ទៅ​ការ​ផ្លាស់ទី​ធំ​នៃ​ព្រួញ​ក"
"ណ្ដុរ​នៅ​លើ​អេក្រង់ "
"សូម្បី​ពេល​អ្នក​ធ្វើ​ការ​ផ្លាស់ទី​តូច​ជាមួយ​ឧបករណ៍​ពិត​ក៏​ដោយ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A multiplier between <guilabel>1x</guilabel> and <guilabel>3x</guilabel> "
"will works well for many systems. With a multiplier over <guilabel>3x</guilabel> "
"the mouse pointer may become difficult to control."
msgstr ""
"មេគុណ​រវាង <guilabel>1x</guilabel> និង <guilabel>3x</guilabel> "
"នឹង​ធ្វើការ​ល្អ​សម្រាប់​ប្រព័ន្ធ​ច្រើន ។ ជាមួយ​និង​មេគុណ​ដែល​ធំ​ជាង <guilabel>"
"3x</guilabel> ព្រួញ​កណ្ដុរ​អាច​ពិបាក​ក្នុង​ការ​ត្រួត​ពិនិត្យ ។"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pointer threshold"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The threshold is the smallest distance that the mouse pointer must move on the "
"screen before acceleration has any effect. If the movement is within the "
"threshold, the mouse pointer moves as if the acceleration were set to <guilabel>"
"1x</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"The threshold is the smallest distance that the mouse pointer must move on the "
"screen before acceleration has any effect. If the movement is within the "
"threshold, the mouse pointer moves as if the acceleration were set to <guilabel>"
"1x</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Thus, when you make small movements with the physical device (&eg; mouse), you "
"still have fine control of the mouse pointer on the screen, whereas larger "
"movements of the physical device will move the mouse pointer rapidly to "
"different areas on the screen."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can set the threshold value by dragging the slider button or by clicking "
"the up/down arrows on the spin-button to the left of the slider."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In general, the higher you set the <guilabel>Pointer acceleration</guilabel> "
"value, the higher you will want to set the <guilabel>"
"Pointer threshold</guilabel> value. For example, A <guilabel>"
"Pointer threshold</guilabel> of 4 pixels may be appropriate for a <guilabel>"
"Pointer Acceleration</guilabel> of 2x, but 10 pixels might be better for 3x."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:199
#, no-c-format
msgid "Double click interval"
msgstr "ចន្លោះ​ពេល​ចុច​ទ្វេរ​ដង"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the maximum amount of time between clicks for &kde; to register a "
"double click. If you click twice, and the time between those two clicks is less "
"than this number, &kde; recognizes that as a double click. If the time between "
"these two clicks is greater than this number, &kde; recognizes those as two "
"<emphasis>separate</emphasis> single clicks."
msgstr ""
"នេះ​គឺ​ជា​ចំនួន​អតិបរមា​នៃ​ពេល​វេលា​រវាង​ការ​ចុច​សម្រាប់ Kde "
"ដើម្បី​ចុះ​ឈ្មោះ​ការ​ចុច​ទ្វេរ​ដង ។ បើ​អ្នក​ចុច​ពីរ​ដង "
"ហើយ​ពេល​វេលា​រវាង​ការ​ចុច​ទាំងពីរ​នោះ​តិច​ជា​ចំនួន​នេះ Kde "
"សម្គាល់​ថា​ជា​ការ​ចុច​ទ្វេរ​ដង ។ "
"បើ​ពេល​វេលា​​រវាង​ការ​ចុច​ទាំងពីរ​ទាំងនេះ​ធំ​ជាង​ចំនួន​នេះ Kde "
"សម្គាល់​ថា​ទាំងនោះ​គឺ​ជា​ការ​ចុច​តែ​មួយ​ពីរ​ដង <emphasis>ផ្សេង​គ្នា</emphasis>"
" ។"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:211
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Drag start time</guilabel> and <guilabel>Drag start "
"distance</guilabel>"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>អូស​ពេល​ចាប់ផ្ដើម</guilabel> និង <guilabel>"
"អូស​ចម្ងាយ​ចាប់ផ្ដើម</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:215
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you <itemizedlist> <listitem><para>click with the mouse</para></listitem> "
"<listitem><para>drag within the time specified in <guilabel>"
"Drag start time</guilabel>, and </para></listitem> <listitem><para>"
"move a distance equal to or greater than the number (of pixels) specified in "
"<guilabel>Drag start distance</guilabel></para> </listitem> </itemizedlist> "
"&kde; will drag the selected item."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mouse wheel scrolls by"
msgstr "កង់​កណ្ដុរ​រមូរ​ដោយ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:232
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have a wheel mouse, use the slider to determine how many lines of text "
"one <quote>step</quote> of the mouse wheel will scroll."
msgstr ""
"បើ​អ្នក​មាន​កណ្ដុរ​កង់ "
"ប្រើ​គ្រាប់​រំកិល​ដើម្បី​កំណត់​ចំនួន​បន្ទាត់​នៃ​អត្ថបទ​ដែល​​មួយ <quote>"
"ជំហាន</quote> នៃ​កង់​កណ្ដុរ​នឹង​រមូរ ។"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:243
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mouse Navigation"
msgstr "ដំណើរ​ផ្លាស់ទី​ព្រួញ​កណ្ដុរ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:245
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This tab allows you to configure the keyboard number pad keys as a mouse-type "
"device. This may be useful when you are working on a device without another "
"pointing device, or where you have no other use for the number pad."
msgstr ""
"ថេង​នេះ​អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យ​អ្នក​កំណត់​រចនា​សម្ព័ន្ធ​គ្រាប់ចុច​បន្ទះ​លេខ​ក្ដារ​ចុច​ជា​ឧ"
"បករណ៍​ប្រភេទ​កណ្ដុរ ។ នេះ​អាច​មាន​ប្រយោជន៍ "
"ពេល​អ្នក​កំពុង​ធ្វើការ​លើ​ឧបករណ៍​ដែល​គ្មាន​ឧបករណ៍​ចង្អុល​មួយ​ផ្សេង​ទៀត "
"ឬ​ដែល​អ្នក​មិន​ប្រើ​បន្ទះ​លេខ​ផ្សេង​ទៀត ។"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid "Move pointer with keyboard (using the num pad)"
msgstr "ផ្លាស់ទី​ព្រួញ​ជាមួយ​ក្ដារ​ចុច (ដោយ​ប្រើ​បន្ទះ​លេខ)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:254
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To enable keyboard mouse mode, you need to select the checkbox labelled "
"<guilabel>Move pointer with keyboard (using the num pad)</guilabel>"
". When you do this, the other settings will become enabled, and you can "
"customize the keyboard pointer behavior further, if required."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:257
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The various keys on the number pad move in the direction you would expect. Note "
"that you can move diagonally as well as up, down, left and right. The <keycap>"
"5</keycap> key emulates a click to a pointer button, typically &LMB;. You "
"change which button is emulated by using the <keycap>/</keycap> "
"key (which makes it &LMB;), <keycap>*</keycap> key (which makes it &MMB;) and "
"<keycap>-</keycap> (which makes it &RMB;). Using the <keycap>+</keycap> "
"emulates a doubleclick to the selected pointer button. You can use the <keycap>"
"0</keycap> key to emulate holding down the selected pointer button (for easy "
"dragging), and then use the <keycap>.</keycap> to emulate releasing the "
"selected pointer button."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:264
#, no-c-format
msgid "Acceleration delay"
msgstr "ផ្អាក​ការបង្កើន​ល្បឿន"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:266
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
